Subject: [PATCH] v3.0.7: open the release rung

The fleet rung for the window since v3.0.0: v3.0.1 (Policy Routing fail-open and the dead self-heal runner), v3.0.3/v3.0.4 (speed test, the OpenSSL 3.5 migration withdrawn, self-heals held off early boot), v3.0.5 (Policy Routing Rung B, diag v1.3.13, Warden resolver carve-out) and v3.0.6 (full backup carries /jffs, settings export embeds the .CFG). Version bump only; every change is in the commits below it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 release/src-rt/version.conf | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/release/src-rt/version.conf b/release/src-rt/version.conf
index 8114167bff..aa4f1fe4b0 100644
--- a/release/src-rt/version.conf
+++ b/release/src-rt/version.conf
@@ -4,6 +4,6 @@ KERNEL_VER_AM=$(subst .,,$(KERNEL_VER))
 FS_VER_AM=$(subst .,,$(FS_VER))
 
 SERIALNO=102.8
-EXTENDNO=Reaper_v3.0.6
+EXTENDNO=Reaper_v3.0.7
 
 RCNO=0
